āh a goodly loan, He will multiply it for you and forgive you. And Allāh is [most] Appreciative and Forbearing,","j":28,"h":56,"s":64,"a":17,"sd":null},{"k":"64:18","t":"Knower of the unseen and the witnessed, the Exalted in Might, the Wise.","j":28,"h":56,"s":64,"a":18,"sd":null}],"juz":28,"hizb":56,"surahs":[64],"sajdah":false}